  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>”Aww, too bad!\"</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> The Monty Scoop, The Monty Shuffle, character level 15th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per day, when your target's player chooses two cards as detailed in The Monty Scoop feat, you may resolve the Monty deck twice, once for each card picked.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> You choose one of your target's player's two picks and resolve the Monty deck once as though the chosen pick were the only card picked.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
